{
  "id": "RAW_f9dfc6243c",
  "title": "运行时日志现已显示缓存原因 - Vercel",
  "url": "https://vercel.com/changelog/runtime-logs-now-show-cache-reasons",
  "date": "2026-07-17 09:00:00",
  "author": "Shina Patel",
  "siteName": "Vercel News",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-start gap-6 flex-initial\" data-customer-story=\"false\">\n   <div class=\"contents [&amp;&gt;h2:first-child]:!pt-0 [&amp;&gt;h3:first-child]:!pt-0\" data-blog-body=\"true\">\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Runtime logs now show a Cache Reason explaining why a request wasn't a fresh cache hit, for example a time-based or tag-based revalidation. Use cache reasons to debug misses and improve your hit rate.</p>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Cache reasons appear for any response the CDN can cache, including ISR, Partial Prerendering, and functions that set a <code>Cache-Control</code> header with directives like <code>stale-while-revalidate</code>. Responses rendered dynamically on every request don't have a cache reason.</p>\n    <div class=\"scroller-module__aGa9CG__overlayContainer mb-10 mt-6 h-fit! max-w-[900px]! w-fit! @max-sm:my-2 @max-sm:-mx-6 @max-sm:w-[calc(100%+51px)]! scrolle